  "meta": {
    "updated": "2026-09-08",
    "note": "Standard menu — one CORE eaten identically every day (= the Rest day), plus an EARNED BLOCK added only after the activity actually happened. Protein and fat are fixed across all three modes; only carbs move. Every mode runs the same ~300 kcal deficit, so a fully-rest week and a fully-training week lose the same amount — no penalty for missing a session, no need to decide the day type in advance."
